<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Hoodwink Bushwack (W) has longer projectile speed to Acorn Shot (Q).
Thus, ones can cast Acorn right after Bushwack to plant a tree.

This macro allows canceling backswing animation after casting Bushwack thus ensure chances of success disable.

How to use:
1. Turn Acorn to auto to plant a tree upon impact (Alt+Q).
2. Stand more than 350 units distance, best with longer distance, e.g. Aether Lens.
3. Point the mouse on the enemy, cast macro, and move the mouse a little bit back (50-100 units) to your hero's location, done in about 200ms.
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 50 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 140 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 90 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 53 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 53 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Dota 2</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>